  "term": "incremental learning",
  "definition": "Incremental learning is a way for a model to keep learning new categories over time while trying to retain what it learned earlier. In this packet, it specifically refers to class-incremental learning, where the challenge is to add new classes without old knowledge drifting or being forgotten.",
